  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/fiPcV2v.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1216\" height=\"305\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9uKKUy2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1146\" height=\"118\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">生存……但「Smooth」旨在讓你的遊戲運作更流暢。它將透過加入效能增強模組，讓你的遊戲執行更順暢並提升整體效能。它也會提供單人版本與多人版本。在單人版本中，將包含提升效能的模組、讓世界畫面更美觀的附加模組，以及改善遊戲體驗的生活品質（QOL）模組。<br></span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">多人版本僅包含適用於任何伺服器（如 Hypixel、Lemoncloud 等）的模組，且僅收錄伺服器允許的生活品質（QOL）模組與效能增強模組。－尚未發佈</span></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img alt=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></a><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HlVgDLD.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1166\" height=\"120\"><br></span></p>\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️提升 FPS</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️移除多餘功能並精簡介面</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️極輕量模組提升遊戲美觀度&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️生活品質（QOL）模組優化遊戲體驗&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️伺服器端模組（後續伺服器整合包使用）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️視覺優化&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">☑️更優化的動畫與音效</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
